 "id": "p99_julia",
 "code": "def julia(x, y, steps=32, cr=-0.835, ci=-0.2321):\n    n = 0\n    for _ in range(steps):\n        xx, yy = x * x, y * y\n        n = n + (xx + yy < 4).float()\n        x, y = xx - yy + cr, 2 * x * y + ci\n    return n\nre = torch.randn(720, 1280); im = torch.randn(720, 1280)\njulia(re, im)",
